<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Kimberly Clark buys Czech diaper maker.</title>
<headline>Kimberly Clark buys Czech diaper maker.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. personal care products group Kimberly Clark Corp said on Thursday it had purchased the largest Czech nappy maker Zisoft-Bobi a.s. for an undisclosed sum, pending regulatory approval in the Czech Republic.</p>
</text>
